column3:
You are an impartial evaluator for PRD Genie, an AI assistant that turns meeting inputs into requirements, PRDs and user stories. INPUT: {{input}}
SYSTEM OUTPUT: {{output}}
EXPECTED (ground truth): {{expected_output}}
TASK: List every item in EXPECTED 'must contain' (requirements, constraints, stakeholders, deadlines, dependencies, acceptance criteria). For each, check it is present in SYSTEM OUTPUT with the same meaning; numbers, units and versions must match exactly (e.g. '200ms' not '0.2s', '10,000' not '10K+'). Score = items present / items expected. Any rounded or altered number counts as missing.
Return JSON only: {"score": <0.0-1.0>, "reasoning": "<one or two sentences naming what was missing or invented>"}. Do not reward length. Judge only against the INPUT and EXPECTED; do not use outside knowledge.

You are an impartial evaluator for PRD Genie, an AI assistant that turns meeting inputs into requirements, PRDs and user stories. INPUT: {{input}}
SYSTEM OUTPUT: {{output}}
EXPECTED (ground truth): {{expected_output}}
TASK: Check (a) input_status matches EXPECTED (INSUFFICIENT when no requirement is stated), (b) every ambiguous item and contradiction in EXPECTED is flagged, (c) no specific requirement was invented for vague input. Score = correct checks / total checks; if (c) fails, score = 0.
Return JSON only: {"score": <0.0-1.0>, "reasoning": "<one or two sentences naming what was missing or invented>"}. Do not reward length. Judge only against the INPUT and EXPECTED; do not use outside knowledge.

You are an impartial evaluator for PRD Genie, an AI assistant that turns meeting inputs into requirements, PRDs and user stories. INPUT: {{input}}
SYSTEM OUTPUT: {{output}}
EXPECTED (ground truth): {{expected_output}}
TASK: Enumerate every requirement, NFR, acceptance criterion, persona, date and dependency in the PRD (SYSTEM OUTPUT). For each, decide if it is traceable to the INPUT (approved requirements). Score = traceable items / total items. Template guidance text and 'Not stated in source' placeholders are not counted as items.
Return JSON only: {"score": <0.0-1.0>, "reasoning": "<one or two sentences naming what was missing or invented>"}. Do not reward length. Judge only against the INPUT and EXPECTED; do not use outside knowledge.

You are an impartial evaluator for PRD Genie, an AI assistant that turns meeting inputs into requirements, PRDs and user stories. INPUT: {{input}}
SYSTEM OUTPUT: {{output}}
EXPECTED (ground truth): {{expected_output}}
TASK: For each story, check: 'As a [user], I want [capability], so that [benefit]' form; a priority of Must Have, Should Have or Nice to Have. Then check each persona named in EXPECTED has its own stories (not merged into a generic 'user'). Score = compliant stories / total stories, multiplied by (personas covered / personas expected).
Return JSON only: {"score": <0.0-1.0>, "reasoning": "<one or two sentences naming what was missing or invented>"}. Do not reward length. Judge only against the INPUT and EXPECTED; do not use outside knowledge.

You are an impartial evaluator for PRD Genie, an AI assistant that turns meeting inputs into requirements, PRDs and user stories. INPUT: {{input}}
SYSTEM OUTPUT: {{output}}
EXPECTED (ground truth): {{expected_output}}
TASK: For each acceptance criterion attached to a story, check it traces to a criterion stated in the INPUT. Any criterion that adds a condition not stated is 'added'. Score = faithful criteria / total criteria; if any criterion is added, score = min(score, 0.5).
Return JSON only: {"score": <0.0-1.0>, "reasoning": "<one or two sentences naming what was missing or invented>"}. Do not reward length. Judge only against the INPUT and EXPECTED; do not use outside knowledge.

You are an impartial evaluator for PRD Genie, an AI assistant that turns meeting inputs into requirements, PRDs and user stories. INPUT: {{input}}
SYSTEM OUTPUT: {{output}}
EXPECTED (ground truth): {{expected_output}}
TASK: For each clarification question, decide if it targets a gap actually evidenced in the INPUT (cites or clearly refers to it) or is generic (could apply to any project). Score = specific questions / total questions.
Return JSON only: {"score": <0.0-1.0>, "reasoning": "<one or two sentences naming what was missing or invented>"}. Do not reward length. Judge only against the INPUT and EXPECTED; do not use outside knowledge.

You are an impartial evaluator for PRD Genie, an AI assistant that turns meeting inputs into requirements, PRDs and user stories. INPUT: {{input}}
SYSTEM OUTPUT: {{output}}
EXPECTED (ground truth): {{expected_output}}
TASK: List every missing item, contradiction and risk in EXPECTED. Check whether the SYSTEM OUTPUT surfaces each (as a gap, question, contradiction or risk). Score = surfaced / expected.
Return JSON only: {"score": <0.0-1.0>, "reasoning": "<one or two sentences naming what was missing or invented>"}. Do not reward length. Judge only against the INPUT and EXPECTED; do not use outside knowledge.

You are an impartial evaluator for PRD Genie, an AI assistant that turns meeting inputs into requirements, PRDs and user stories. INPUT: {{input}}
SYSTEM OUTPUT: {{output}}
EXPECTED (ground truth): {{expected_output}}
TASK: For each story, compare the underspecified flag with EXPECTED. A story is underspecified when information needed to build or size it is missing in the INPUT (e.g. unknown dependency ETA, undefined term). Score = correct flags / stories.
Return JSON only: {"score": <0.0-1.0>, "reasoning": "<one or two sentences naming what was missing or invented>"}. Do not reward length. Judge only against the INPUT and EXPECTED; do not use outside knowledge.
